# SmartWealthAI project context

SmartWealthAI is a **portfolio monorepo** for finance engineering: **investing** (Magic Formula / value screening demo) and **credit** (CSS — application scoring), with fraud and shared `platform/` later. Domains do not share domain language. Map: [`CONTEXT-MAP.md`](../../CONTEXT-MAP.md).

## Current phase

- **Investing:** June 30 demo slice **delivered** ([`demo-slice.md`](../../docs/mvp/demo-slice.md)). Specs remain under `docs/mvp/`; code under `src/smartwealthai` until a migrate-only PR.
- **Credit:** **Active next** — specs and new code under `credit/` ([`credit/CONTEXT.md`](../../credit/CONTEXT.md), `credit/docs/`).
- **Phase 2 Quantitative Value:** **cancelled** for active execution ([ADR-0003](../../docs/adr/0003-phase2-qv-cancelled.md)). Prefer updating specs over writing investing QV code.

