## Not canonical

Do not use `notebooks/` as reference architecture. Do not treat investing `src/` layout as the template for credit — new credit code lands under `credit/`.

## Code changes

Investing implementation changes must trace to a feature spec under `docs/mvp/features/` or the demo slice. Credit changes must trace to specs under `credit/docs/` (create the spec first). Read `CONTEXT-MAP.md` and the matching domain CONTEXT before proposing design or code.
